      "decision_index": 33,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Used Lightning Strike as face burn (3 damage) while opponent has an empty board, spending the only removal spell. With the opponent having lost life this turn, a Hired Claw +1/+1 counter activation would provide permanent board improvement, and holding Lightning Strike preserves crucial removal for incoming threats like Appa or Doc Aurlock.",
