      "decision_index": 34,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Playing Floodfarm Verge instead of Temple Garden limits development this turn. Temple Garden (entering untapped for 2 life) would provide {G} alongside Hallowed Fountain's {U}, enabling an immediate Doc Aurlock cast - a key enabler that makes spells from exile cost {2} less, synergizing perfectly with Appa's airbend ability. With Floodfarm Verge, green mana requires paying 1 life from Starting Town anyway, and Doc Aurlock can't be cast this turn.",
